# The raw generations behind public/ (about 940 MB) stay out of git, all but their notes (prompts,
# seeds, picks, the ledgers of paid calls). They're attached to a GitHub release, one archive per
# pack: `pnpm sources:fetch` puts them back (scripts/assets/sources.mjs). The worlds' check
# screenshots beside them (review-*, fix-*, shots, phase-*) are kept locally only.
assets-src/**
!assets-src/**/
!assets-src/**/*.json
!assets-src/**/*.jsonl
!assets-src/**/*.md
release/
